# Feature: AI-Powered Development Workflow Landing Page (HACKATHON WINNER)

## Summary

Building a stunning React landing page that showcases AI-powered development workflows for hackathon victory. The page demonstrates how AI-human collaboration creates genuinely impressive experiences beyond generic AI aesthetics. **META-TWIST**: This landing page itself is built using the exact AI workflow it teaches - a living demonstration of the methodology.

## User Story

As a hackathon judge
I want to see innovative AI development workflows in action
So that I can evaluate technical excellence, educational value, and real-world applicability

## Problem Statement

Generic AI-generated websites lack personality and craftsmanship. Developers need proven workflows that combine AI efficiency with human creativity to produce genuinely impressive results that win competitions and real projects.

## Solution Statement

Create a performance-optimized React landing page using cutting-edge tech stack (Vite 7 + Motion + Tailwind V3) that teaches and demonstrates advanced AI development workflows through interactive sections, real examples, and stunning visual design.

## Metadata

| Field            | Value                                             |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Type             | NEW_CAPABILITY                                   |
| Complexity       | MEDIUM                                           |
| Systems Affected | Frontend, Deployment, Content Management          |
| Dependencies     | Vite 7.0.0, React 18+, Motion, Tailwind CSS V3  |
| Estimated Tasks  | 12                                               |

