## State-of-the-Art Technology Research

**Context7 Research Findings - Best Libraries for Hackathon Victory:**

### Core Stack
| Technology | Library ID | Version | Benchmark Score | Why Chosen |
|------------|------------|---------|-----------------|------------|
| **Build Tool** | `/vitejs/vite` | 7.0.0 | 76.9 | Latest performance optimizations, instant HMR |
| **Animation** | `/websites/motion_dev_react` | Latest | 74.0 | Production-grade, native performance |
| **Styling** | `/websites/v3_tailwindcss` | V3 | 85.9 | Utility-first rapid development |

### Key Technical Advantages
- **Vite 7.0.0**: `baseline-widely-available` target, optimized builds
- **Motion for React**: Native browser performance + JavaScript flexibility
- **Tailwind CSS V3**: Utility-first with excellent performance (highest benchmark score)

