## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] **Visual Excellence**: Design impresses hackathon judges, not generic AI look
- [ ] **Educational Value**: Teaches actionable AI development workflows  
- [ ] **Technical Innovation**: Uses cutting-edge tech stack (Vite 7, Motion, Tailwind V3)
- [ ] **Performance**: Lighthouse score 90+, sub-1s loading, 60fps animations
- [ ] **Mobile Perfect**: Flawless experience on all devices and screen sizes
- [ ] **Real Content**: Genuine AI examples and prompts, not fabricated demos
- [ ] **Meta Demonstration**: Page built using the workflow it teaches
- [ ] **Demo Ready**: Works perfectly for live hackathon presentation

