## Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| **Design looks AI-generated** | MEDIUM | HIGH | Invest heavily in landing-page-creator skill iteration |
| **Performance issues on mobile** | LOW | HIGH | Test early and often, optimize images, use Motion performance patterns |
| **Time pressure affects quality** | HIGH | MEDIUM | Focus on Phase 1 essentials, cut non-critical features |
| **Deployment problems last-minute** | MEDIUM | HIGH | Set up Vercel early, test deployment process |
| **AI examples seem fabricated** | MEDIUM | HIGH | Document real workflow with actual prompts/outputs |

